<urn:atm:triage:finding/ATM-QA-U9-011>
  a triage:Finding ;
  triage:findingId "ATM-QA-U9-011" ;
  triage:title "docs/atm-daemon/requirements.md not updated with advisory stream requirement" ;
  triage:description "docs/atm-daemon/requirements.md does not include a requirement for the live advisory stream capability introduced in U.9. The only 'advisory' mention found (line 296) refers to filesystem advisory locks, not the graft advisory stream. The new GraftAdvisoryStreamRequest/Response and the daemon-side stream_nudges path are not reflected as a functional requirement in the daemon requirements doc." ;
